0	Last Order: "I'll make it so you can't cry or laugh\nanymore! Misaka Misaka gets fired up!"
1	Last Order: "Listen up! Right now you are a nameless\nmaggot! Remember that well!"
2	Last Order: "I'll take my time and give you lots of love!\nBe grateful!"
3	Last Order: "Do your best to scream nicely and\nentertain Misaka!"
4	Last Order: "Would it be agreeable for me to\ncontinue?!"
5	Last Order: "To forge a pathetic weakling like you into a\nwarrior! That is Misaka's mission!"
6	Last Order: "What's wrong, what's wrong! Worn out\nalready?!"
7	Last Order: "Faking being tired to get Misaka's\nsympathy? You no-good loser-spirited person-san!"
8	Last Order: "You can still go, right? Don't hold back!"
9	Last Order: "Finish this training and you'll graduate from\nmaggot to warrior! Hang in there!"
10	Last Order: "Stop scurrying around! Annihilate the\nenemy like your life depends on it, recruit!"
11	Last Order: "I'll drill you till you crack! Consider it an\nhonor, you limp little brat!"
12	Last Order: "This is the last one, recruit! Show me you\ncan overcome yourself!"
